# Tanaris (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Tanaris: the Bilgewhizzle Wastewander chain
# (with its Undercity pre), the Fizzledowser report, the Pestlezugg
# finale, Quinns desert job and the Uldum Pedestal return (band 38-50;
# the 841 repeatable, the Fire Plume key mold and the ectoplasm return
# are out with reasons in the census). Every accept is on key 1446;
# the Undercity, Thunder Bluff and Orgrimmar legs ride honest expedition
# steps below. See docs/tanaris-horde-census.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/tanaris-horde
title Tanaris (Horde)
levels 38-50
zone Tanaris
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Expedition - Undercity, Zinges errand

  zone Undercity

  goto 50.14,67.97
  accept 243 -- Into the Field - Apothecary Zinge; Bilgewhizzle takes the word in Gadgetzan
  note 243 accepts in the Undercity and ends in-zone at Bilgewhizzle - take it here; holders use the mini below.
  buy 8523 "Field Testing Kit" npc 7683 -- the testing kit off Alessandro Luca for the Tanaris field work
  note Luca (58.61, 54.68) sells the kit; it rides back to Tanaris for 654 below.
  zone Tanaris

step Gadgetzan, mustering

  zone map 1446

  note Gadgetzan is the Horde hub: Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle (52.46, 28.51), Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser (50.21, 27.48), Alchemist Pestlezugg (50.89, 26.96) and Quinn (51.12, 27.88) hold the rise. Take the hubs asks here; the Wastewander camps and the pedestal fill them.
  goto 52.46,28.51
  accept 379 -- Slake That Thirst - Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle; five Wastewander Water Pouches, east
  note 379 needs 243 (Into the Field, Undercity-accept, unrouted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; holders use the mini below.
  goto 50.21,27.48
  accept 32 -- Rise of the Silithid - Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser; Zilzibin waits in Orgrimmar, late
  note 32 needs 113 (Insect Part Analysis, shared, main-contracted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; its turn-in is an Orgrimmar expedition, late.
  goto 50.89,26.96
  accept 4509 -- Calm Before the Storm - Alchemist Pestlezugg; Zilzibin waits in Orgrimmar, late
  note 4509 needs 4507 (Pawn Captures Queen, shared, main-contracted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; its turn-in rides the same Orgrimmar leg as 32.
  goto 51.12,27.88
  accept 97534 -- Gritty Business - Quinn; seven Desert Debris, late
  note 97534s debris names no placed source in the data - have seven Desert Debris (item 278191) in bags; hand them in on the return. Its Alliance twin 97536 is unroutable for Horde - no gate needed.

step Gadgetzan, the Zinge pre

  when onquest 243
  goto 52.46,28.51
  turnin 243 -- Into the Field - Zinges word to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  accept 379 -- Slake That Thirst - Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle; five Wastewander Water Pouches, east
  note Holders of 243 turn in here first, then take 379 on the same terms as the muster above. 243 accepts in the Undercity and lives outside this trackers list.

step East - the Wastewander camps

  collect 8483 x5 @58.62,36.68 era -- five Wastewander Water Pouches off the Wastewander for Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, east
  note The family works two camps east - Rogue, Shadow Mage and Assassin around (58-60, 35-40) at 50-53%, Thief and Bandit around (59-61, 22-25) at 52%; work both for all five pouches.
  goto 59.01,23.42
  note The southern camp holds the Thief and Bandit points - finish the five here if the north left any short.

step Gadgetzan, first return

  zone map 1446

  goto 52.46,28.51
  turnin 379 -- Slake That Thirst - the pouches to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  accept 654 -- Tanaris Field Sampling - Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle; the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source starts it
  note 654 waited on 379s turn-in - take it here with the Model (item 8524) in bags; the Model names no source in the data. 841 (Another Power Source, repeatable) is excluded - named, not routed. The kits already in bags from the Undercity leg; the 8/8/8 samples name no source in the data - work them as the kit allows and hand everything in on the return.

step South-west - the Uldum Pedestal

  zone map 1446

  goto 37.63,81.40
  accept 2967 -- Return to Thunder Bluff - the Uldum Pedestal; Nara waits in Thunder Bluff, late
  note 2967 needs 2954 (The Stone Watcher, shared, main-contracted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; its turn-in is a Thunder Bluff expedition, late.

step Gadgetzan, second return

  zone map 1446

  goto 52.46,28.51
  turnin 654 -- Tanaris Field Sampling - the samples and kit to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  accept 864 -- Return to Apothecary Zinge - Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle; Zinge waits in the Undercity, late
  note 864 waited on 654s turn-in - its turn-in is an Undercity expedition, late.
  goto 51.12,27.88
  turnin 97534 -- Gritty Business - the debris to Quinn
  note 97534s debris filled from bags per the muster note - hand it in here.

step Expedition - Thunder Bluff, Naras word

  zone Thunder Bluff

  turnin 2967 -- Return to Thunder Bluff - the pedestals word to Nara Wildmane @75.65,31.61 era
  note Nara holds Thunder Bluff - the pedestal errand closes here.
  zone Tanaris

step Expedition - Orgrimmar, Zilzibins reports

  zone Orgrimmar

  turnin 32 -- Rise of the Silithid - the report to Zilzibin Drumlore @56.26,46.68 era
  turnin 4509 -- Calm Before the Storm - Pestlezuggs report to Zilzibin Drumlore @56.26,46.68 era
  note Both silithid reports close at Zilzibins side.
  zone Tanaris

step Expedition - Undercity, Zinges kit return

  zone Undercity

  turnin 864 -- Return to Apothecary Zinge - the sealed kit to Apothecary Zinge @50.14,67.97 era
  note The Bilgewhizzle chain closes at Zinges side.
  zone Tanaris

